        evFin F v (GlobalTheory.WeilM.symp (GlobalTheory.IndefiniteRowSideFullHecke.WeilTensorModels.cA σ) (inclR (F := F) (AF F) ξ) (GlobalTheory.IndefiniteRowSideFullHecke.WeilTensorModels.incM F JX)
